426
00:23:31,160 --> 00:23:35,000
If that heavier race car runs head on into a concrete barrier,

427
00:23:35,100 --> 00:23:37,800
the kinetic energy is released all at once,

428
00:23:37,900 --> 00:23:41,580
with the force being absorbed by boat car and driver.

429
00:23:45,180 --> 00:23:48,140
But a crash with a lighter car that can spin, tumble,

430
00:23:48,141 --> 00:23:52,040
and shatter releases the kinetic energy over a greater period

431
00:23:52,140 --> 00:23:54,140
