has huge potential for military use.

766
00:41:40,621 --> 00:41:44,860
They would like to have a missile that goes, say, Mach 5,

767
00:41:44,861 --> 00:41:47,380
Mach 6, five or six times the speed of sound,

768
00:41:47,381 --> 00:41:49,620
so it can get to a target very quickly.

769
00:41:49,621 --> 00:41:51,300
With scramjet propulsion,

770
00:41:51,301 --> 00:41:53,900
bombers could strike anywhere in the world.

771
00:41:53,901 --> 00:41:57,200
at speeds 10 times faster than current jets.

772
00:41:57,540 --> 00:41:59,780
There's no reason that a human couldn't pilot

773
00:41:59,781 --> 00:42:02,120
or be a passenger on a hypersonic airplane.

774
00:42:02,620 --> 00:42:04,160
Vision vehicles, as we call them,

775
00:42:04,240 --> 00:42:07,960
include space access vehicles to take astronauts

776
00:42:07,961 --> 00:42:10,840
to the space station or to orbit,

777
00:42:11,360 --> 00:42:13,900
and also potentially passenger vehicles, again,

778
00:42:13,960 --> 00:42:16,060
to take people to the other side of the world.

779
00:42:16,880 --> 00:42:20,040
It's no surprise that our number one marvel of speed

780
00:42:20,041 --> 00:42:22,920
is thrusting us into a hypersonic future.

781
00:42:23,900 --> 00:42:28,240
On this high octane countdown of our top 10 speediest marbles,

782
00:42:28,241 --> 00:42:30,900
we've raced some of the fastest crafts on the planet

783
00:42:30,901 --> 00:42:33,400
against each other.

784
00:42:33,401 --> 00:42:37,440
On land, air, and sea.

785
00:42:37,441 --> 00:42:40,860
After this supersonic journey, there's no question

786
00:42:40,861 --> 00:42:43,560
that faster is better.

787
00:42:43,561 --> 00:42:47,360
Just don't forget to stop and smell the roses once in a while.

